6. Role Architecture

Roles:

customer
admin
super_admin

Use Firebase custom claims only for authorization hints/claims.

Do not store: - profile; - preferences; - booking data; - packagepermissions; - large application objects

inside Firebase custom claims.

Firebase recommends using custom claims for access control and storingother data separately. citeturn0search0

MongoDB remains the application-level source for role/permissions.

For highly sensitive operations, resolve the MongoDB user on the server.

