25. Reliability Rules

Use transactions where multiple MongoDB writes must remainconsistent.

Make payment callbacks idempotent.

Make notification failures non-destructive to successful databasemutations.

Retry safe external operations.

Never duplicate bookings because a client retries a request.

Use unique booking references.

Use unique favourite constraints.

Validate all uploaded files.